      {
        "id": 128164,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-22T23:06:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The word heal is not a game mechanic in Sentinels.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is recovery, which is the only thing that gets increases and decreases.</p><p>There is regaining, which is the in game turn for the act of raising HP. &nbsp;Regaining is Recovery.</p><p>Then there is restoring, which is to a certain amount, regardless of the amount before restoring. &nbsp;Restoring is now clarified to not be Recovery.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for doing that Pydro, I had completely forgotten about that.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
